            { "text": "監視・移行エージェントは、Azure Monitor・Azure Migrate の既存の画面から呼び出す", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/copilot/agents", "locator": "冒頭", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-25T20:50:00Z" }] }
